      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": -200
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Start here: nf-core/rnaseq example",
        "icon": "StickyNote",
        "noteText": "This workflow runs the complete nf-core/rnaseq 3.27.0 pipeline: read QC, trimming, alignment with STAR, quantification with Salmon, and a MultiQC report.\n\nIt is preset to the pipeline's small test data (yeast reads, downloaded on the fly), so it runs as it is. Duplicate it to change anything.",
        "inputs": [],
        "outputs": []
      }
    },
